{"variants":[{"traits":[{"interfaceLanguage":"swift"}],"paths":["\/documentation\/ioslibrary\/iosnotificationmanager\/installdelegate()"]}],"metadata":{"modules":[{"name":"IosLibrary"}],"title":"installDelegate()","extendedModule":"IosLibrary","symbolKind":"method","fragments":[{"text":"static","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"func","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"installDelegate","kind":"identifier"},{"text":"() -> ","kind":"text"},{"text":"NotificationDelegateInstallResult","kind":"typeIdentifier","preciseIdentifier":"s:10IosLibrary33NotificationDelegateInstallResultO"}],"roleHeading":"Type Method","externalID":"s:10IosLibrary0A19NotificationManagerC15installDelegateAA0cF13InstallResultOyFZ","role":"symbol"},"kind":"symbol","identifier":{"url":"doc:\/\/com.jonghyunkim.nativetoolkit.IosLibrary\/documentation\/IosLibrary\/IosNotificationManager\/installDelegate()","interfaceLanguage":"swift"},"sections":[],"abstract":[{"text":"Installs the library’s ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"UNUserNotificationCenterDelegate"},{"text":" on","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"UNUserNotificationCenter.current()"},{"text":", keeping the current delegate as the previous delegate.","type":"text"}],"hierarchy":{"paths":[["doc:\/\/com.jonghyunkim.nativetoolkit.IosLibrary\/documentation\/IosLibrary","doc:\/\/com.jonghyunkim.nativetoolkit.IosLibrary\/documentation\/IosLibrary\/IosNotificationManager"]]},"primaryContentSections":[{"declarations":[{"platforms":["iOS"],"languages":["swift"],"tokens":[{"text":"@discardableResult","kind":"attribute"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"static","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"func","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"installDelegate","kind":"identifier"},{"text":"() -> ","kind":"text"},{"text":"NotificationDelegateInstallResult","kind":"typeIdentifier","preciseIdentifier":"s:10IosLibrary33NotificationDelegateInstallResultO","identifier":"doc:\/\/com.jonghyunkim.nativetoolkit.IosLibrary\/documentation\/IosLibrary\/NotificationDelegateInstallResult"}]}],"kind":"declarations"},{"content":[{"text":"Return Value","anchor":"return-value","type":"heading","level":2},{"inlineContent":[{"text":"","type":"text"},{"isActive":true,"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/com.jonghyunkim.nativetoolkit.IosLibrary\/documentation\/IosLibrary\/NotificationDelegateInstallResult\/installed"},{"text":", or","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"isActive":true,"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/com.jonghyunkim.nativetoolkit.IosLibrary\/documentation\/IosLibrary\/NotificationDelegateInstallResult\/notMainThread"},{"text":" when called on another thread.","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}],"kind":"content"},{"content":[{"text":"Discussion","anchor":"discussion","type":"heading","level":2},{"inlineContent":[{"text":"The library’s delegate presents the library’s notifications in the foreground with","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"isActive":true,"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/com.jonghyunkim.nativetoolkit.IosLibrary\/documentation\/IosLibrary\/IosNotificationManager\/foregroundPresentationOptions"},{"type":"text","text":" and hands the responses to them to "},{"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/com.jonghyunkim.nativetoolkit.IosLibrary\/documentation\/IosLibrary\/IosNotificationManager\/responses","isActive":true},{"type":"text","text":" (and the"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"system’s requests to show the app’s notification settings to "},{"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/com.jonghyunkim.nativetoolkit.IosLibrary\/documentation\/IosLibrary\/IosNotificationManager\/settingsRequests","isActive":true},{"type":"text","text":"). A"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"notification that is not the library’s (another component’s, a push, or one a 1.x version","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"of the library scheduled) goes to the previous delegate when it implements the delegate","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"method, and is handled like the library’s when it does not. The previous delegate is held","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"weakly, and only one is kept: installing again after another object replaced the library’s","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"delegate makes that object the previous delegate in place of the earlier one, which is then","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"reached only if that object forwards to it.","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"header":"row","rows":[[[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"Situation","type":"text"}]}],[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"What the call does","type":"text"}]}]],[[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Not on the main thread"}]}],[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"Nothing; returns ","type":"text"},{"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/com.jonghyunkim.nativetoolkit.IosLibrary\/documentation\/IosLibrary\/NotificationDelegateInstallResult\/notMainThread","isActive":true},{"text":" at once","type":"text"}]}]],[[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"The library’s delegate is the current delegate"}],"type":"paragraph"}],[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Nothing"}],"type":"paragraph"}]],[[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"First call in the process","type":"text"}]}],[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"Installs it before returning, and starts watching ","type":"text"},{"code":"UNUserNotificationCenter.delegate","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" and ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"UIApplication.didBecomeActiveNotification"}]}]],[[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"Another object replaced the library’s delegate since","type":"text"}]}],[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"Installs it again in front of that object, which becomes the only previous delegate (logged)","type":"text"}]}]]],"type":"table"},{"inlineContent":[{"text":"When another object replaces ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"UNUserNotificationCenter.delegate"},{"text":" later, the library logs a","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"warning and does not install itself again: call this method again to restore it. A","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"response that launches the app is delivered only to the delegate that is set when","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"code":"application(_:didFinishLaunchingWithOptions:)","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" (or ","type":"text"},{"code":"scene(_:willConnectTo:options:)","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":")","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"returns, so a later call loses it; the call still installs the delegate and logs that this","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"may be after launch when the app is already active.","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"Do not install the library’s delegate again in front of a delegate that","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"forwards to the library asynchronously (calls the library from a later turn, another","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"queue or a task): only a call that comes back synchronously while the library forwards","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"is recognised as a cycle.","type":"text"}]}],"type":"aside","style":"important","name":"Important"},{"style":"important","name":"Important","content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"Call it at launch. In a SwiftUI app, ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"App.init"},{"text":" and the","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"code":"UIApplicationDelegateAdaptor","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":"’s ","type":"text"},{"code":"application(_:didFinishLaunchingWithOptions:)","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" both","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"work. ","type":"text"},{"code":"App.init","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" (like a call before ","type":"text"},{"code":"UIApplicationMain","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" in a UIKit ","type":"text"},{"code":"main.swift","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":") runs","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"before the application object exists: the library then takes the app for not active yet,","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"so the response that launches the app is still found by ","type":"text"},{"isActive":true,"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/com.jonghyunkim.nativetoolkit.IosLibrary\/documentation\/IosLibrary\/IosNotificationManager\/launchResponse()"},{"text":" and nothing","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"is logged about a late install.","type":"text"}]}],"type":"aside"},{"style":"note","name":"Note","content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"Main thread only, synchronous, never waits; it may be called again (idempotent).","type":"text"}]}],"type":"aside"}],"kind":"content"}],"schemaVersion":{"patch":0,"major":0,"minor":3},"references":{"doc://com.jonghyunkim.nativetoolkit.IosLibrary/documentation/IosLibrary/NotificationDelegateInstallResult":{"abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"The result of "},{"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/com.jonghyunkim.nativetoolkit.IosLibrary\/documentation\/IosLibrary\/IosNotificationManager\/installDelegate()","isActive":true},{"type":"text","text":"."}],"kind":"symbol","fragments":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"enum"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"NotificationDelegateInstallResult"}],"navigatorTitle":[{"kind":"identifier","text":"NotificationDelegateInstallResult"}],"title":"NotificationDelegateInstallResult","type":"topic","role":"symbol","identifier":"doc:\/\/com.jonghyunkim.nativetoolkit.IosLibrary\/documentation\/IosLibrary\/NotificationDelegateInstallResult","url":"\/documentation\/ioslibrary\/n